{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"スター姫さがし太郎や1stシングルの時から\n渡辺美優紀さん(みるきーさん)推しだった私。\n全国握手会にも行き、神戸の卒業ライブ\nにも行きました...\nそれくらい大好きなアイドルです。\n笑顔、パフォーマンス、お顔全てがかわいい！\n特にソロ曲、わるきーが大好きということで\n私の生誕委員の方がわざわざ私仕様に\nわるきー衣装を作ってくださいました...>_<...\n嬉しい～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、幕張に\nみおきー出没( ^ω^ )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2017/01/24/3085014/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちらっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2017/01/24/3085014/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん\n♡みおきー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎好きなもの...人\n◎女の子は二の腕 男の子は腹筋が好き\n◎お腹が空くと機嫌が悪くなり拗ねます\n◎いたずらが大好き\n◎ツンデレ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みおきーはとにかく人間がだいすきです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2017/01/24/3085014/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりあ～\nカワイイカワイイ( ^ω^ )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2017/01/24/3085014/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろさんもつかまえた～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2017/01/24/3085014/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部でみおきー帰っちゃったけど\nまた、いつか、\n現れるかも☺︎！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上腕二頭筋ってセクシー♩\nばいばーい"}],"source":"archive"}